WEBVTT

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:01.816
Maybe at best, upload
your consciousness to a silicon chip.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.680
And accept your extinction."

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.096
(Laughter)

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:09.496
And I said, "No, human beings are special.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:13.056
We can embrace ambiguity,
we understand paradox,

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.696
we're conscious,
we're weird, we're quirky.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:19.056
There should be a place for humans
in the digital future."

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.616
And he said, "Oh, Rushkoff,

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.936
you're just saying that
because you're a human."

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.736
(Laughter)

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.360
As if it's hubris.

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.080
OK, I'm on "Team Human."